    The vendored runtime is unmodified upstream source. The CLI wrapper
    patches only pyproject.toml during `setup` (PyTorch index and optional
    pynini removal) and writes generated state under videotrans/.

    Channel index tables, language codes and default Edge-TTS voices in
    .claude/skills/trans-video-cli/scripts/trans_cli.py and references/
    are derived from pyVideoTrans source files.

